From: HackerOS Linux System <hackeros068@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH 18/35] hackeros: raw socket sysctl dla red team

Dodaje sysctl hackeros_redteam_raw_mode umozliwiajacy kontrolowane
przydzielanie uprawnien raw socket dla narzedzi penetration testowych
(scapy, hping3, nmap SYN scan) bez wymuszania full root.

---
 net/ipv4/raw.c | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

--- a/net/ipv4/raw.c
+++ b/net/ipv4/raw.c
@@ -1118,3 +1118,10 @@
 	if (register_pernet_subsys(&raw_sysctl_ops))
 		panic("RAW: failed to init sysctl parameters.\n");
 }
+
+#ifdef CONFIG_HACKEROS_REDTEAM
+/* HackerOS Red Team: raw socket mode dla grup red team.
+ * 0=standard (CAP_NET_RAW wymagany), 1=red team mode (GID-based). */
+int __maybe_unused hackeros_redteam_raw_socket_mode __read_mostly = 0;
+EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL(hackeros_redteam_raw_socket_mode);
+#endif /* CONFIG_HACKEROS_REDTEAM */
--
2.43.0
